  <name>OpenRGB HTTP Hook Plugin</name>
  <icon type="stock">openrgb-scheduler-http-hook</icon>

  <content_rating type="oars-1.0" />

  <summary>HTTP Hook plugin for OpenRGB that allows OpenRGB profile changes via HTTP POST/GET</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      The OpenRGB HTTP Hook Plugin is a plugin for OpenRGB that can trigger
      actions including profile changes from HTTP requests.
    </p><p>
      Features
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Trigger profile changes</li>
      <li>Supports both HTTP POST and GET</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

